## Build

- An import macro that merges new survey responses, detects duplicates and sorts the data.
- Pivot refresh and sync that adds month columns automatically and calculates the survey rate per branch and dealer group.
- Batch export of one PDF report per dealer group, plus an all-dealer summary.

